---
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro'
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro'
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro'
---

<Page
  title="Early access - Sift"
  description="Sift: YouTube, without the noise."
  canonical="https://sifttheweb.com/pricing.html"
  root="./"
>
  <SiteHeader root="./">
    <a class="header-link" href="./">Back to Sift</a>
  </SiteHeader>
  <main id="main" class="wrap pricing-page" tabindex="-1">
    <p class="section-label">Sift early access</p>
    <h1>Three months of Pro.<br />On us.</h1>
    <p class="lede">For the first 1,000 people to activate early access. No card required.</p>
    <div class="install-actions"><a class="install-cta" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/edhndblebjdnecafmjcbmcdfemmojala"><span>Add to Chrome</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="preview-link" href="./beta/">Or try Sift Preview</a></div>
    <p class="install-note">For Chrome on desktop. No card required.</p>
    <section class="early-access" aria-label="About early access">
      <div class="early-access-copy"><h2>A little more<br />understanding.</h2><p>Summaries, chat, and Pro features released during your three months. Includes 400 summaries and chat answers combined per calendar month, shared across your devices.</p><p class="install-note"><a href="./#roadmap">See what's next</a></p></div>
      <div class="early-access-faq">
        <details open><summary>When do my three months start?</summary><p>When you activate your offer. One offer per person, for the first 1,000 activations. Installing alone doesn't reserve a place.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What happens afterward?</summary><p>Choose a paid plan or keep using Sift for free. We'll share pricing at least 30 days before your offer ends. No automatic charge.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What will Pro cost?</summary><p>We're still shaping Sift and haven't set the paid price. You'll know the price before deciding whether to upgrade.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter root="./" />
</Page>
